 "description": "DEV-3031 B3.6 \u2014 audited participant work-email read (participant_work_email.get): the canonical managed @opentrain.work primary address for a participant you manage through EXACTLY ONE of {contractId}, {proposalId}, or {jobId, personUserId} \u2014 a bare user id is never accepted, and mixed/unknown selector keys fail with ZERO network access. structuredContent IS the raw closed response object \u2014 no wrapper. ONLY the ACTIVE state carries an address (normalized lowercase, exactly under opentrain.work, provider mailbox confirmed); ended contracts read as typed CONTRACT_ENDED, un-hired proposals as typed NOT_HIRED, and the personal signup/login/OAuth/resume email is NEVER returned in any state. Requires the dedicated participant_work_email:read scope (separate from payments/candidate-dossier scopes), a claimed account, and the default-off participant-work-email agent surface; employer or named canonical-admin authority for the exact context is enforced server-side, candidate self receives a typed SELF_ACCESS_NOT_SUPPORTED denial, and every authenticated attempt is audited append-only BEFORE any address is disclosed. The response is runtime-validated against the closed state machine \u2014 a mismatched upstream body is a typed failure telling you to upgrade this package, never forwarded data.",
